Java 1.3 Build Prerequisites
==============================

ecj.jar  — Eclipse standalone compiler (reused from java14/). Runs on Java 8
           and produces class file version 47 (Java 1.3) when given
           -source 1.3 -target 1.3.

rt.jar   — NOT INCLUDED. Must be extracted from a J2SE 1.3.1 distribution and
           placed here as java13/rt.jar before running build-java13.sh.

rt.jar is listed in .gitignore and must not be committed (Oracle license).
